Comment: 9,0:22:03.72,0:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,TO BE CONTINUED
Comment: 9,0:23:29.01,0:23:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You three, don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.11,0:00:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near the water!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even try to play tricks on us.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know one of you\Ndid this to us!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who killed the guard
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.25,0:00:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and just tried to drown us,\NI know she's among you.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.30,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely have to find\Nthe murderer right now,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.59,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,or we're all done for!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.14,0:00:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, I said.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.39,0:00:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Atroe said\Nshe didn't recognize you.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember her\Nfrom the assembly?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you either.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.32,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know perfectly well\NI've been here since the start.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:50.91,0:00:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember your face.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.04,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't remember\Nyou either, bitch.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.08,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who just\Nmade that radio call.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.71,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be a trap of yours.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:01.46,0:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.71,0:01:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The black-haired one,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,your nose is bleeding.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:09.01,0:01:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.05,0:01:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see it from where I was.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:12.14,0:01:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, when you struck\Nthe enemy Stand,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:15.77,0:01:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,someone almost passed out.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:19.18,0:01:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:25.32,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This bitch just hit me!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:28.57,0:01:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she's bleeding too!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:34.99,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:36.62,0:01:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Her tooth scraped my arm!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:39.04,0:01:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here from the start, damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:41.29,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only these two are left\Nas suspects.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:44.17,0:01:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. I saw the warden\Nwith his alligator puppet.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you two as well.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one acting up over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:51.51,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:52.81,0:01:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as suspicious as...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:58.93,0:01:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:02.31,0:02:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this bitch the one who attacked us?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:07.57,0:02:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have no idea\Nwho the murderer is.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:11.91,0:02:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to hit everyone!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:19.87,0:02:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:21.37,0:02:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:25.71,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning to finish them off\None by one in the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:32.55,0:02:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought
Dialogue: 9,0:02:35.18,0:02:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,she had that thread
Dialogue: 9,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and would survive our attack?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these chicks?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they all kill him?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:46.36,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the Stand user?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one user
Dialogue: 9,0:03:03.50,0:03:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for each Stand and each power.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:07.46,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who were there from the start
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.09,0:03:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,are the black-haired one\Nand the short-haired one.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:20.43,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed them\Nbecause they were getting close to the tractor.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.27,0:03:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I digested\Ntheir bodies and their minds.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This body, I created it...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:31.40,0:03:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,from the limbs of the missing inmates.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The black sludge comes from the two bodies.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.76,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My divided parts\Nreunited into one.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,For the power and the intelligence
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that Whitesnake's discs\Ngranted me,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.19,0:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defend myself at all costs.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my duty
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.11,0:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to eliminate anyone who gets\Nclose to the barn.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.82,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this Stand's user?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.49,0:05:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.16,0:05:48.87,TiretsDefault,,563,0,0,, He is the Stand's user.\N What?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a living creature
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that received life and power\Nthrough the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The guardian of the discs wasn't human.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A living creature?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.09,0:06:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You mean a conglomerate\Nof those tiny little bastards?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.51,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be using\Nthe water from his victims' bodies
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.35,0:06:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to move on dry land\Nand guard the barn.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He stays on land by multiplying.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But just like a car\Nneeds gasoline,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs water to live.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:22.58,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll only be able to retrieve the discs
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.49,0:06:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,by keeping this creature\Naway from the water
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and reducing it to nothing!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Jolyne,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.04,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,how could a swarm of vermin\Nbe able to speak?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.04,0:06:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Foo Fighters!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:37.93,0:06:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When you talk about me,\Nuse my name!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.84,0:06:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,An astronomer named Fred Hoyle\Nonce said
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.43,0:06:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that it's statistically false\Nto claim life appeared on Earth{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by pure coincidence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.89,0:06:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A power called intelligence\Nexisted in the universe{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.36,0:06:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}long before the Earth was formed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.57,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It gave birth to life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.15,0:07:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Intelligence has existed\Nlonger than the Big Bang.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:07.20,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Every particle, every organism,\Ncontains intelligence.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:11.58,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this\Nbullshit now?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.75,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saying our intelligence\Nisn't specifically human.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.30,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even plankton has memory, and...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.43,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to call me Foo Fighters!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.89,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a being of intelligence\Nsuperior to yours!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.68,0:07:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.73,0:07:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to try to hide the discs\Nbefore we find them.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he buries them,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.81,0:07:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}our chances are over!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.19,0:07:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, there's a big problem.\NLook behind you.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:42.53,0:07:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the creature\Nthat attacked us in the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.49,0:07:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to drag the guard's body.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bracelets, remember.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stay within 50 meters of him.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to give up on the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take\Nthe guard's body back!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, our bracelets will explode.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You handle the bracelets, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,While I run the 50 meters,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.56,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you get the guard's body
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.31,0:08:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring it within 50 meters\Nof me.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:18.69,0:08:21.52,TiretsDefault,,659,0,0,, It's the only solution.\N Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.65,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a woman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's completely nuts!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.82,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What does she want me to do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, damn it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he gets the guard's body,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's over for Jolyne and me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to act now!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it, damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll never use\Nthe sticker like that again.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.11,0:09:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have another arm\Npushed out of me again.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to juggle, damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:16.74,0:09:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,\Nwithin 50 meters of the barn.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The water.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.47,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn little worms!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That scream...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.15,0:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you've won?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:50.74,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the original corpse,\Ndried to the bone.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.62,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a trace of moisture left in it.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My sticker doubled it.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.09,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I remove the sticker...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.13,0:10:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You absorb water\Nlike a sanitary pad.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or like a drop of water\Nfalling in the desert.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.81,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're in the way!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.23,0:10:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to dehydrate him.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.07,0:10:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way\Nto beat these bastards.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right on time.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:58.68,0:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way,\NI'm going to kill you both.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.73,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to torture you\Nafter hiding the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.78,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.78,0:11:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to jump into that puddle?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.49,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you going to try to run away?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Which death do you prefer?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.58,0:11:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have questions too.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who knows who you are.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:28.21,0:11:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Whitesnake?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.34,0:11:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,what is his goal?\NWhy does he collect the discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the logic\Nof offensive defense.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.81,0:11:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for an ally\Ndoesn't resonate much with me,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems reasonable too.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.78,0:11:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I don't understand\Nwhy you want to die here.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.24,0:11:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:56.28,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? I've never met him.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was distracted?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheap!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:09.21,0:12:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All these puddles\Nare extensions of myself!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were planning to open this sack of flour
Dialogue: 9,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to absorb the water?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.02,0:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:25.52,0:12:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my own power
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.40,0:12:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've created the optimal\Nenvironment for myself.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be so bad
Dialogue: 9,0:12:34.53,0:12:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to use your body\Nas a host for a while.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already lost.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:41.32,0:12:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This environment you created for yourself\Nby splashing water everywhere
Dialogue: 9,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,will be your downfall.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.30,0:13:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even hear me\Nstart the tractor with my threads.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The noise was covered by the sound of the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:04.60,0:13:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You let yourself get distracted trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.31,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,\Nyou've failed to guard the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.90,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You... Bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.61,0:13:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get them!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.45,0:13:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,These discs are mine!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.42,0:13:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The soil of this field is much softer\Nthan that of the swamps.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.30,0:13:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it absorbs all the water.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And there's no shortage of water!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:46.93,0:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger\Non these discs...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.44,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne won the battle of minds.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.07,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs no longer belong to you.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.66,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dry up and feed the crops!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.09,0:14:28.89,TiretsDefault,,561,0,0,, Jolyne, what the hell are you doing?\N I'm giving him water.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just say
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.52,0:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm saving him.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.73,0:14:34.60,TiretsDefault,,788,0,0,, What?\N Foo Fighters
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.73,0:14:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't guarding the discs\Nout of loyalty to Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.44,0:14:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.53,0:14:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he knew\Nhis body was going to perish,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,he went after the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.58,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was guarding the discs\Nto protect himself.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.63,0:14:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs gave him\Npower and intelligence.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.25,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wanted to protect them,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it was to thank them\Nfor the miracle that was his life.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.96,0:15:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't care less about Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:06.18,0:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to save him?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.27,0:15:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed five people!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.98,0:15:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's literally not human!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's not human,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,then he doesn't understand\Nthe concept of evil.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake is the villain.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.57,0:15:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake only gave him\Nenough information
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to guard the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.20,0:15:28.24,TiretsDefault,,836,0,0,, Well, I'll be...\N Besides,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.45,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have another reason\Nto save his life.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:34.04,0:15:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs,\NI want you to keep guarding them.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.46,0:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But do it for us.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect them\Nfrom Whitesnake's dirty hands.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:45.22,0:15:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention\Nof taking these discs from you.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.18,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want my father's.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.35,0:15:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to know\Nwhat Whitesnake is up to.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:57.32,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Will you help us?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.15,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But no more killing humans.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really something.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:07.95,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite understand you,
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't feel like fighting anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost anyway.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.17,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wiped out.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So the discs really were\Nin the tire!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally found them!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.49,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Hey!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Star Platinum disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.92,0:17:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My father, Jotaro Kujo,\Ncan be brought back to life with it.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally have it!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.80,0:17:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But no trace of his memory disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could it be?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.81,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.31,0:17:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I jump out this window,\Ndo you think I'll die?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:23.69,0:17:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:28.28,0:17:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F. Call me that.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.03,0:17:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I collected what was left of her.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:38.75,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I added another inmate's\Nbracelet.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:41.17,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to use this body as a host\Nfor a while.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.17,0:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This hand is useless, though.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.21,0:17:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to take her life from her?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.35,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll live in her cell,\Nas a prisoner?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect you.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:01.23,0:18:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this body's memory,\Nher name is Atroe.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.82,0:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate FE39423.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:09.32,0:18:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Her childhood dream was to be kidnapped.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.95,0:18:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But when she grew up,\Nshe kidnapped a child.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.91,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't for a ransom.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:20.21,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know why she did it.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.17,0:18:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:23.17,0:18:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arms are bleeding.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.21,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I can't heal them.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.60,TiretsDefault,,561,0,0,, Damn it, what are you doing?\N That's gross!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:43.35,0:18:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You should wait a bit\Nbefore going back to prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to learn\Nto drink from a glass first?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.20,0:18:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,From a glass?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Child's play!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:56.20,0:18:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking from a glass, too easy.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blech.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.00,0:19:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, about Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:04.63,0:19:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he come to the barn often?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.46,0:19:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, rarely.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:10.59,0:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen his user.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.96,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs that are here\Nare the ones he can't use.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's an incompatibility,\Nthe body rejects the disc,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how powerful it is.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All these discs are ones\Nhe can't use.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.77,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be hiding\Nthe important discs somewhere else.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why
Dialogue: 9,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the memory disc you're looking for\Nisn't in this pile.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.03,0:19:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What he wanted to tear from your father
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.87,0:19:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't an invincible Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was his memory.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:44.46,0:19:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father must know\Nsome secret information.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:52.42,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards are coming.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.51,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Jolyne?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the Star Platinum disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give this to the foundation
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that takes care of my father.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.90,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't revive him soon,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,his body will start to rot.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.57,0:20:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find his memory disc
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.86,0:20:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it out of the prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.45,0:20:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's harder to get things out of here\Nthan to bring them in.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And the guards are going to\Nstrip-search us.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.46,0:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see that disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.29,0:20:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shape my boobs.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:42.97,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., raise your hands,\Nor they'll shoot you.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:49.39,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard was attacked by an alligator.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.94,0:20:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We saved him.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:54.36,0:20:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know what happened\Nto the other inmates.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:57.28,0:20:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We stick to that story, okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She was nothing but bait.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.60,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne was only supposed to lure Jotaro.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:22.43,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she'd be harmless.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.56,0:21:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She defeated the guard all by herself\Nand retrieved the discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the surviving inmates
Dialogue: 9,0:21:35.78,0:21:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,help Jolyne?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:39.07,0:21:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will set soon.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:42.16,0:21:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You must return\Nto your quarters.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.29,0:21:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that worried\Nabout the missing ones,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.13,0:21:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Pucci?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:56.25,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
